      "label": "4.60.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "अवतीर्य च विन्ध्य अग्रात् कृच्छ्रेण विषमात् शनैः |\nतीक्ष्ण दर्भाम् वसुमतीम् दुःखेन पुनर् आगतः",
      "iast": "avatīrya ca vindhya agrāt kṛcchreṇa viṣamāt śanaiḥ |\ntīkṣṇa darbhām vasumatīm duḥkhena punar āgataḥ",
      "translation": "'I again reached the earth descending from the lopsided peak of Mt. Vindhya, onerously and slowly, whereat the sacred-grass-blades are thorny...",
      "notes": [
        "The grass blades became thorny because sages nipped their apices and they dried up and became thorny for a wingless eagle perching almost on its belly."
      ],
