    {
      "id": "4.60.11",
      "label": "4.60.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "तम् ऋषिम् द्रष्टु कामो अस्मि दुःखेन अभ्यागतो भृशम् |\nजटायुषा मया चैव बहुशो अभिगतो हि सः",
      "iast": "tam ṛṣim draṣṭu kāmo asmi duḥkhena abhyāgato bhṛśam |\njaṭāyuṣā mayā caiva bahuśo abhigato hi saḥ",
      "translation": "\"As I was desiring to see that sage I neared that place with much anguish, because I and Jataayu approached that sage for many a time in earlier times...",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
