          "iast": "bahuśaḥ abhigataḥ hi",
          "devanagari": "बहुशः अभिगतः हि",
          "meaning": "many times, [he was] approached, indeed.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 11
        }
      ]
