      "label": "4.60.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "तस्य आश्रम पदाभ्याशे ववुः वाताः सुगन्धिनः |\nवृक्षो न अपुष्पितः कश्चित् अफलो वा न दृश्यते",
      "iast": "tasya āśrama padābhyāśe vavuḥ vātāḥ sugandhinaḥ |\nvṛkṣo na apuṣpitaḥ kaścit aphalo vā na dṛśyate",
      "translation": "\"Near about his hermitage wind wiffles with a sweet-smell, and no tree is flowerless and no tree is fruitless, whatsoever it is...",
      "notes": [],
