      "label": "4.60.14",
      "numbers": [
        14
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथ पश्यमि दूरस्थम् ऋषिम् ज्वलित तेजसम् |\nकृत अभिषेकम् दुर्धर्षम् उपावृत्तम् उदन् मुखम्",
      "iast": "atha paśyami dūrastham ṛṣim jvalita tejasam |\nkṛta abhiṣekam durdharṣam upāvṛttam udan mukham",
      "translation": "\"Then I saw the sage available distantly, returning facing north after performing his holy bath, an unassailable sage irradiating the ambience with his radiance...",
