    {
      "id": "4.60.15",
      "label": "4.60.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "तम् ऋक्षाः सृमरा व्याघ्राः सिंहा नाना सरी सृपाः |\nपरिवार्य उपगच्छन्ति दातारम् प्राणिनो यथा",
      "iast": "tam ṛkṣāḥ sṛmarā vyāghrāḥ siṃhā nānā sarī sṛpāḥ |\nparivārya upagacchanti dātāram prāṇino yathā",
      "translation": "\"Bears, antelopes, tigers, lions, and diverse reptiles and snakes are following him at his heel, as with living beings following a donor, or all-donating Brahma...",
