    {
      "id": "4.60.16",
      "label": "4.60.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "ततः प्राप्तम् ऋषिम् ज्ञात्वा तानि सत्त्वानि वै ययुः |\nप्रविष्टे राजनि यथा सर्वम् स अमात्यकम् बलम्",
      "iast": "tataḥ prāptam ṛṣim jñātvā tāni sattvāni vai yayuḥ |\npraviṣṭe rājani yathā sarvam sa amātyakam balam",
      "translation": "\"As to how the ministerial and military staff retrace steps when a king enters his place-chambers, so also the animals and other beings on knowing the sage's entry into his hermitage, retraced their steps and went away...",
