    {
      "id": "4.60.17",
      "label": "4.60.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "ऋषिः तु दृष्ट्वा माम् तुष्टः प्रविष्टः च आश्रमम् पुनः |\nमुहूर्त मात्रान् निर्गम्य ततः कार्यम् अपृच्छत",
      "iast": "ṛṣiḥ tu dṛṣṭvā mām tuṣṭaḥ praviṣṭaḥ ca āśramam punaḥ |\nmuhūrta mātrān nirgamya tataḥ kāryam apṛcchata",
      "translation": "\"But the sage is gladdened on seeing me and though he has entered into his hermitage he again came out in a moment and asked about the objective of my visit...",
